== file Search
POST {{base_url}}/graphql
X-Client: sonde-import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
```graphql
query { users { id name } }
```
== file Upload avatar
POST {{base_url}}/upload
X-Client: sonde-import
[BasicAuth]
admin: {{admin_password}}
[Multipart]
file: file,./avatar.png; image/png
caption: hello
== file Users/Create user
# opencollection after-response script:
# console.log(res.status)
POST {{base_url}}/users
X-Client: sonde-import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{"name": "{{name}}"}
== file Users/List users
# Lists one user by id.
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{id}}
X-Client: sonde-import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
[Options]
variable: id="1"
[Query]
active: true
HTTP 200
== extra secrets/local.secrets (keep=true)
api_key=
